### Get all movies
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### Get movies by genre
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Drama

### Get movie by id
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/13bdc84b-96b4-4f3a-87d3-831b3f1f3def

### Create a new movie 2
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "PEPE",
  "year": 2008,
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "duration": 152,
  "poster": "https://i.ebayimg.com/images/g/yokAAOSw8w1YARbm/s-l1200.jpg",
  "genre": ["Action", "Crime", "Drama"],
  "rate": 9.0
}

### Update a movie
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/f3d2836b-df14-4333-8ea2-2e9e5db366f8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2010
}

### Delete a movie
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/f3d2836b-df14-4333-8ea2-2e9e5db366f8

### Create a new movie 3
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

